  metadata below.
title: >-
  Residual-Aware Soft Routing with Adaptive Model-Usage Control for
  Time-Series Forecasting
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Dongyang
    affiliation: INTI International University
abstract: >-
  A reproducible implementation and compact evidence package for routing
  causal one-step-ahead time-series forecasts between Ridge and LightGBM
  under an adaptive target for simple-model usage.
keywords:
  - time-series forecasting
  - model routing
  - soft labels
  - residual learning
  - adaptive control
  - reproducible machine learning
